:: Quest Gabe Bail Out 2 [nobr]

<span style="color:lightcoral">You gulp as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> looks down at you, crossing his arms and smirking. Somehow, whenever he was in charge, he looked taller.</span> You step to the side, trying to get around your brother, and say that you are just going to head to your room to relax, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> stops you. <br>

